1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:12,000
folder B dammit— how MANY times do I have to tell you man?! It's 34 employees!

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Have you, or anyone you know, rage-quit a coding session? Join the club, buddy.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Our agents have a memory problem. Two weeks later, it's like you don't remember what I said.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
So this is how my girlfriend feels.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Every agent wakes up stateless. All that intelligence—and no continuity.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
But people tell me the fix is simple…

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Just get a 6-million-billion context window? Long context isn't memory. It's a tax.

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
A META job? Pro. Put me in the metaverse, let me cook.

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:05,000
How do we solve context? I'm not. Put the fries in the bag, bro. I asked: what CAN I do?

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Q1: WHAT makes me remember? Where does my brain say "remember this"?

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Q2: WHEN does it hand it back? How does it know NOW is the time?

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Q3: WHY a story, not a row? Not a row. A scene.

13
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Something to watch. Something to save. Something to hand it back.

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Observer, Scribe, Retriever. RAG is one leg. This is the whole animal.

15
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Simulate the brain's solutions. Never simulate its constraints.

16
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Theory is cheap. Watch it think. It just… knows.

17
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Truth changes—it rewrites. Noise arrives—it throws it away.

18
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:10,000
It doesn't search. It associates.

19
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Take the memory away, and the genius becomes a goldfish.

20
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Then it sleeps—and generalizes.

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Nothing works the first time. So I built a second agent to fight the first one.

22
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
We don't ask you to trust it. 22 of 22. Zero leak. Four for four.

23
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Built on Meta. Muse Spark. Build for Your World.

24
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:50,000
The dev, the person, the company brain.

25
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:56,000
Everything I was mad at my girlfriend for… and her birthday.

26
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,000
TOTTIE. It just remembers.
